{"availability":"available","full":"anishonly121/insightstack-blueprint","name":"insightstack-blueprint","description":"Full-stack AI finance analytics — upload any bank CSV, get GPT-4o insights in 60 seconds. Next.js 16 · TypeScript · PostgreSQL · Prisma · Stripe · 29 integration tests. Live demo ↗","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-14T08:04:29Z","updated":"2026-08-03T05:36:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://insightstack-peach.vercel.app","topics":["ai","finance","full-stack","jwt-authentication","nextjs","openai","portfolio","postgresql","prisma","react","recharts","saas","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://insightstack-peach.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.019Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.019Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.019Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.019Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Upload your transactions. Understand your spending. Get AI-driven recommendations.","InsightStack is a production-grade full-stack SaaS that turns raw CSV bank exports into a visual financial dashboard with AI-powered spending insights. The AI layer is a custom-built engine — BM25 information retrieval, linear regression, an expert rule system, and intent-based chat — with zero external AI API dependency. Built end-to-end with real auth, real payments, 29 integration tests and a Playwright E2E suite — no mocks.","Most finance apps that offer AI insights require you to connect your bank account via OAuth — giving a third-party service live read access to your transactions in exchange for a spending report."],"features":["Register, login, logout, forgot password, reset password via email","JWT signed tokens + HttpOnly cookie auth (both supported simultaneously)","bcrypt password hashing (10 rounds)","Enumeration-safe forgot-passwo